            {
                "entry_id": "fecfd2ed-0fc7-3315-a447-26d67968f61c",
                "word": "marmonnement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4632de73-e67d-439c-8a21-5cf73a4d92c6",
                        "entry_id": "fecfd2ed-0fc7-3315-a447-26d67968f61c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "marmonnements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "aa59ced8-802a-3dcf-a187-4c8eadb8b85c",
                        "entry_id": "fecfd2ed-0fc7-3315-a447-26d67968f61c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action de marmonner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7be57bbb-e4d6-4bfc-be14-432f5a1c7766",
                                "sense_id": "aa59ced8-802a-3dcf-a187-4c8eadb8b85c",
                                "text": "Mes auditeurs n’avaient sans doute jamais rien entendu de pareil, mais il est probable qu’ils ne comprenaient pas mes marmonnements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f35c578-a839-46de-91e2-ee81281d4aeb",
                                "sense_id": "aa59ced8-802a-3dcf-a187-4c8eadb8b85c",
                                "text": "Dans un marmonnement irrité, il les interpelle par leur prénom, en les tutoyant, et les somme d’intervenir au plus vite."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e607a1fd-2702-4982-9ace-6a4320bc5483",
                                "sense_id": "aa59ced8-802a-3dcf-a187-4c8eadb8b85c",
                                "text": "Des refrains psalmodiés à la manière de prières bouddhiques, sortes de marmonnements incompréhensibles, sortirent de leurs bouches et furent repris par la foule."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c6601c28-9bbb-4547-9482-44739d8f008b",
                        "source_entry_id": "fecfd2ed-0fc7-3315-a447-26d67968f61c",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa59ced8-802a-3dcf-a187-4c8eadb8b85c",
                        "target_lang_word": "mutter",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mutter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0518fce2-d62f-3050-b4c5-c5c4c2517e73",
                                        "entry_id": "8c644a5e-950c-3b2e-abc8-f7ccadfd5273",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Peas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mutter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69e51a80-b56f-357a-97fa-eb213177281e",
                                        "entry_id": "aa1cbfe6-16cb-37d8-a4fb-3c307f15da08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A repressed or obscure utterance; an instance of muttering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc39a472-8f2d-4e58-8786-3d334fa8252b",
                                                "sense_id": "69e51a80-b56f-357a-97fa-eb213177281e",
                                                "text": "The prisoners were docile, and accepted their lot with barely a mutter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mutter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdfdb8b2-468d-347d-88ee-83615c22419e",
                                        "entry_id": "1935f2a3-41d5-3294-86d9-7fe4ca31217f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To utter words, especially complaints or angry expressions, indistinctly or with a low voice and lips partly closed; to say under one's breath."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70a5cab6-bc1e-4c55-9d71-08997777449d",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfdb8b2-468d-347d-88ee-83615c22419e",
                                                "text": "You could hear the students mutter as they were served sodden spaghetti, yet again, in the cafeteria."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f520b7e2-a3a8-46c0-872c-bebafee34c39",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfdb8b2-468d-347d-88ee-83615c22419e",
                                                "text": "The beggar muttered words of thanks, as passersby dropped coins in his cup."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29fa622d-17cd-4f24-b12a-620388e23a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfdb8b2-468d-347d-88ee-83615c22419e",
                                                "text": "This set – the set of Rosol's life – was studded with aces and menacing ground-strokes that left Nadal an impotent spectator often muttering to himself and at the umpire regarding a perceived misdemeanour by his opponent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "822053d4-d579-3faa-9ebc-c1c7ec7ce73e",
                                        "entry_id": "1935f2a3-41d5-3294-86d9-7fe4ca31217f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To speak softly and incoherently, or with imperfect articulations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ebd9899-c21c-4995-8d2a-72d4b6f4261b",
                                                "sense_id": "822053d4-d579-3faa-9ebc-c1c7ec7ce73e",
                                                "text": "The asylum inmate muttered some doggerel about chains and pains to himself, over and over."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db8f30de-1ad7-4f82-8b68-8bbe48c3bb35",
                                                "sense_id": "822053d4-d579-3faa-9ebc-c1c7ec7ce73e",
                                                "text": "Meantime your filthy foreigner will stare, / And mutter to himself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cfb0eac8-d3ab-3d31-a335-cfa2413e7407",
                                        "entry_id": "1935f2a3-41d5-3294-86d9-7fe4ca31217f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a sound with a low, rumbling noise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "781233a0-37dd-49fe-b963-099e08505db9",
                                                "sense_id": "cfb0eac8-d3ab-3d31-a335-cfa2413e7407",
                                                "text": "April could hear the delivery van's engine muttering in the driveway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "552a431f-5807-40b0-89ad-364a3240cc6d",
                                                "sense_id": "cfb0eac8-d3ab-3d31-a335-cfa2413e7407",
                                                "text": "Thick lightnings flash, the muttering thunder rolls."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ed45da3-6214-4bf0-9087-e412a795bbbf",
                        "source_entry_id": "fecfd2ed-0fc7-3315-a447-26d67968f61c",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa59ced8-802a-3dcf-a187-4c8eadb8b85c",
                        "target_lang_word": "geprevel",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "geprevel",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aca5855d-9bbf-3336-bc21-087e57d952cc",
                                        "entry_id": "c0666a8f-214a-3983-bf2d-6b379089d618",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "het aanhoudend onverstaanbaar binnensmonds zacht opzeggen of zingen van iets"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e496e63e-1284-4359-9358-1f9f18fe4637",
                                                "sense_id": "aca5855d-9bbf-3336-bc21-087e57d952cc",
                                                "text": "Balke: „De psalmen zijn typisch iets van Calvijn. Hij had een grote voorliefde voor de psalmen. Luther zong ook graag, maar de psalmen hebben in Duitsland nooit die positie gekregen die ze in het calvinisme verwierven. Maar juist de psalmen waren voor Calvijn van groot belang, ook contra het geprevel van de priesters. Zelf heeft hij in Straatsburg een aanzet gegeven tot de berijming ervan; Marot ging verder, vervolgens Beza.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa24ec2c-f538-4ad4-b056-ebb1b72ed97d",
                                                "sense_id": "aca5855d-9bbf-3336-bc21-087e57d952cc",
                                                "text": "Geprevel van Twentse teksten die moesten worden geleerd en nerveus gedrentel. In de hal van de Performance Factory in Enschede bereiden acteurs zich ieder op hun eigen manier voor op hun auditie voor de Twentse bioscoopfilm ‘De beentjes van Sint Hildegard’."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e77ac96-cd1b-4cb4-b00a-bc479a609e9a",
                                                "sense_id": "aca5855d-9bbf-3336-bc21-087e57d952cc",
                                                "text": "Op elegante hakken, met glanzend haar en in nieuwe jurken wacht de hele familie op de jongste spruit die gedoopt wordt. Dat gaat niet als bij ons, met een soeplepel wijwater over de fontanel en wat geprevel. De zang is indrukwekkend, de orthodoxe priester draagt een prachtig gewaad. De éénjarige wordt eerst ingeolied en dan drie keer geheel ondergedompeld in de doopvont. Longen en stembanden van het kleine meisje lijken prima in orde."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4da36741-5e90-4119-aae3-e1306d2692f1",
                                                "sense_id": "aca5855d-9bbf-3336-bc21-087e57d952cc",
                                                "text": "Geen ge-tsjienk, geen geritsel en geen binnensmonds geprevel dat je alleen van heel dichtbij hoort. Want mijn Twentse dorp is al een maand verstoken van merels. Door het usutu-virus, uit Afrika geïmporteerd door onschuldige zwaluwen. Het ontbreken van die misschien wel best gekende wilde Medelanders valt niet iedereen op. Terwijl de stilte toch oorverdovend is. Geen alarmriedels, geen bozig roepen. Geen luidruchtig oogstwerk van druiven en bessen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
